  <section class="sec">
    <h2>What changed this quarter</h2>
    <p class="p">This section opened on August 1, 2026, so this is its first quarter under observation and there is no earlier period to score it against. Two company results landed inside it. CFE reported lower profit for the first half of 2026, and Pemex reported a better quarter. Neither company's accounts are wired into this site as a series, so those figures stay with the companies' own filings rather than being restated here. Around them, the industrial and logistics coverage kept describing new capacity added by private operators rather than by the state.</p>
    <p class="p">Pump prices barely moved across {{ fuelPrices.window }}, the window the published series covers. The readings that would settle the quarter, generation by technology and grid demand from CENACE, are not wired yet, so this section claims nothing at national scale.</p>
